title: derelict_salvage_start
tags: salvage
---
A drifting cruiser, split in half by some massive impact, floats nearby. Sensors detect lingering radiation and valuable scrap. #line:derelict_salvage_start_00 #illustration:illustration_wreckage
-> Salvage Scrap #line:derelict_salvage_start_01
    <<give_loot loot_base 3>>
    <<jump derelict_salvage_salvage_success>>
-> Scan for Modules #line:derelict_salvage_start_02
    <<if roll(100) <= 40>>
    <<jump derelict_salvage_module_found>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump derelict_salvage_nothing_found>>
    <<endif>>
-> Leave #line:derelict_salvage_start_03 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: derelict_salvage_salvage_success
tags: 
---
You extract useful materials, but the unstable reactor leaks radiation, slightly damaging your hull. #line:derelict_salvage_salvage_success_00
-> Continue #line:derelict_salvage_salvage_success_01
    <<damage_ship 10>>
    <<remove_body>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: derelict_salvage_module_found
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_success>>
Deep in the wreckage, you find an intact Weapon Module! #line:derelict_salvage_module_found_00
-> Take Module #line:derelict_salvage_module_found_01
    <<give_loot loot_salvage_module 1>>
    <<remove_body>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: derelict_salvage_nothing_found
